OL,3,ANobel Peace Prize winner Navi Pillay
OL,4,Adedicates award to 'survivors of
OL,5,Ainternational crime'
OL,6,
OL,7,FNavi Pillay, a former UN human rights
OL,8,Fcommissioner, wins the Nobel Peace
OL,9,FPrize 2026 - here's a bit about her
OL,10,Flife
OL,12,FAfter being told she has won, Pillay
OL,13,Fjokes that she doesn't quite believe
OL,14,Fthe news is real, going on to joke: "If
OL,15,Fyou clap a little bit more I may share
OL,16,Fthis prize with Trump"
OL,18,FIt comes after last year's winner,
OL,19,FVenezuelan opposition leader Maria
OL,20,FCorina Machado, ended up giving her
OL,21,Fprize to the US president - here's why
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
